        {
          "tag": "A1",
          "text": "$v^{2} = (6.67 \\times 10^{-11} \\times 7.5 \\times 10^{23}) / (3.4 \\times 10^{6} + 240 \\times 10^{3})$ so $v = 3.7 \\times 10^{3} \\text{ m s}^{-1}$",
          "guidance": null
